 recover after a hailstorm?\n\nHailstorms can be sudden and destructive. It is important to take immediate action to assess the damage and to start the necessary repair process.\n\n**1. Prioritze your safety.**\n- If there are downed power lines, debris, or dangerous conditions, keep your distance and wait for professionals to clear the area.\n\n**2. Assess the damage.**\n- Start by inspecting your property or vehicle for hail damage. For your home, check the roof, gutters, siding and windows.\n\n**3. Document the damage.**\n- Get in touch with your insurance company as soon as possible and file a claim with the evidence you gathered. Most insurance companies will have specific timeframes within which you need to report the damage.\n- Stay organized by keeping all documents, receipts, and communication related to the hail damage and the related repairs in a safe place.\n\n**4. Seek professional help.**\n- Depending on the severity, it is often best to seek professional assistance for certain repairs.","source":"hail","sectionPath":"After (Recover)","sourceType":"core","embeddingModelVersion":"all-MiniLM-L6-v2-r5","embedding":[-0.083829,0.068445,0.124846,0.04252,0.031026,0.003113,-0.018758,0.034433,-0.006779,-0.062085,-0.064904,-0.019861,0.010715,0.017074,-0.003063,0.012562,-0.041825,-0.007874,-0.00462,-0.017404,-0.05063,0.079148,-0.097076,0.005715,0.071136,0.159949,-0.05056,0.075012,-0.001244,-0.036357,0.014783,-0.03454,-0.032352,-0.048612,-0.041049,0.077683,0.024758,-0.0112,-0.001368,-0.001479,0.015013,0.032741,-0.008233,-0.064887,0.073209,0.074916,0.017766,0.047141,0.114563,-0.014471,0.026834,0.023301,-0.033922,0.017154,-0.018782,0.044853,0.005838,-0.018821,0.074979,-0.010764,-0.067167,0.042078,-0.067534,0.037169,-0.020553,-0.009714,-0.004143,0.050954,0.069625,0.072101,0.082691,0.05789,-0.026177,-0.02795,-0.019027,-0.015482,0.021161,-0.052295,0.029952,0.056619,-0.077087,0.053749,0.014912,0.065638,-0.014323,0.039249,0.030374,0.096045,0.006867,0.037246,-0.045153,-0.